            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "controller_support": "full",
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A reaction game about one very determined locomotive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the driver of an <i>almost</i> real steam train, and it has exactly one setting: faster. React to quick time events to dodge whatever the track throws at you - every second you survive, the speed climbs, until you're running on pure instinct and one missed key ends it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs take seconds to start and a single mistake to end. Crash, curse, restart, get a little further. Your keyboard may not survive. Your high score might.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless, ever-accelerating runs - no finish line, just your limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick time events that start forgiving and end in keyboard destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A leveling system that tracks your progress between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards and 10 achievements - set a record, then defend it</p></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A reaction game about one very determined locomotive.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You're the driver of an <i>almost</i> real steam train, and it has exactly one setting: faster. React to quick time events to dodge whatever the track throws at you - every second you survive, the speed climbs, until you're running on pure instinct and one missed key ends it all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs take seconds to start and a single mistake to end. Crash, curse, restart, get a little further. Your keyboard may not survive. Your high score might.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless, ever-accelerating runs - no finish line, just your limits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Quick time events that start forgiving and end in keyboard destruction</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A leveling system that tracks your progress between runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam leaderboards and 10 achievements - set a record, then defend it</p></li></ul>",
            "short_description": "How long can you keep a runaway locomotive on the tracks? React to quick time events as the speed climbs, survive longer than you did last run, and chase your friends' scores on the global leaderboards. Easy to learn, brutal to master.",
